Update Notice (11/16)
There will be an update scheduled on 11/16. Check out the details below! (GMT+9)

*The maintenance for Official Tournament Match begins on 11/16 12:00. Please note that Official Tournament Match will be suspended for several hours.

Update Details:
1. Tournament Match Update!
2. New Tournament Point (TP) system: Tournament Points can be used to exchange items in the Points Shop; 
3. Riichi Stick - Cat Pillow is available in Station!
4. Optimizations on the display of match score and rank changes;
5. Changes in the material of mahjong table's edge; 
6. Changes the rules of extension into South/West (Please check the setting - rules for details);
7. Optimizations on the watch mode;
8. Other optimization for gaming experience.
